        {
            "title": "「蟲草大王」大圍豪宅淪銀主盤 瑞峰花園一籃子物業開價3,255萬",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">有「蟲草大王」之稱的御藥堂創辦人陳恩德，近年屢傳陷入財困，消息指，陳恩德或相關人士名下大圍<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"瑞峰花園\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:瑞峰花園;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4tkXCWT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">瑞峰花園</a>一籃子物業，最新淪為銀主盤並推出放售，兩個單位連3個車位，合共叫價3,255萬元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">更多消息：</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"大東山百年石屋288萬拍出 近半世紀升值575倍\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:大東山百年石屋288萬拍出 近半世紀升值575倍;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4tkXDtV\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">大東山百年石屋288萬拍出 近半世紀升值575倍</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"屯門緹岸1球銀主盤搶高至204萬沽 樓價6年貶值50%\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:屯門緹岸1球銀主盤搶高至204萬沽 樓價6年貶值50%25;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4zx91Ey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">屯門緹岸1球銀主盤搶高至204萬沽 樓價6年貶值50%</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">其中瑞峰花園1座高層B室，實用面積1,385呎，連864呎天台及車位，叫價1,627.5萬元，呎價11,751元，較陳恩德等2010年購入價1,068萬元高559.5萬元或52%。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-a4cdd53f-a4c3-3625-b8a1-e6dc8798eb65-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"單位放盤相\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/124131d8b2c606d33f1dcc3e4e33b95a026689bb975a605cfd4b8d3ce3fe7d34/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2F56a6450805a2f20efd3653f50d12cfc2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">單位放盤相</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"> 單位放盤相</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">28Hse網站現有<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"該單位放盤\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:該單位放盤;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4j2mduJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">該單位放盤</a>，從放盤相可見，單位L型大廳空間闊落，地面鋪設白色大理石，客廳連接露台，外望開揚山景。</p><a class=\"mb-module-gap\" data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"img\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://i1.28hse.com/2026/11/202611201315193056109_large_nowm.jpg?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f47e5b66ddfa025bb98c8e731829a51947a1905bf3d583f9f0a4d6960a7857f0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2Fecfe7eb7829992adebba429e03559c82.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></a><a class=\"mb-module-gap\" data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"img\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://i1.28hse.com/2026/11/20261120131539302142_large_nowm.jpg?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/794c634668cf22fe4dcb7a7599a9f27270aef7b258c181f1a493ad4d0090a87b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2F80597f490f220ca06f4954e5416e5c1e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></a><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另同座低層A室，實用面積1,592呎，連車位叫價1,522.5萬元，呎價9,563元，較其2010年購入價1,000萬元高522.5萬元或52%。至於另一車位，則叫價105萬元，較2018年購入價250萬元低145萬元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">瑞峰花園由長實發展，位於大圍半山富健街8-12號，鄰近仁安醫院，於1987年入伙，由6座樓宇組成，提供256個伙，主打千呎以上大單位。根據28Hse網站資料，瑞峰花園近期平均成交呎價約8,957元，屋苑現時有<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"12個放盤\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:12個放盤;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4j4bSP5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">12個放盤</a>，叫價1,225萬元至1,650萬元，呎價8,838元至11,905元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據悉，陳恩德早年曾破產，其後成功翻身創辦保健食品公司「御藥堂」且成功將公司上市及賣盤，之後又成為仍志集團主席，進軍「寵物藥妝」市場，全盛時期全港擁有逾百個銷售點。不過，陳恩德於去年9月辭任仍志執行董事及主席，疑與其抵押的股權被人強制出售有關，使其失去大股東身份。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另外，陳恩德在2021年底被指與TVB藝人李佳芯（Ali）秘戀一年，引起全城關注，不過李佳芯隨即發長文與其劃清界限，陳恩德之後亦抽起在TVB每年逾千萬元的電視廣告。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">延伸閱讀: <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"瑞峰花園\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:瑞峰花園;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/瑞峰花園-5357?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">瑞峰花園</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"緹岸\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:緹岸;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/緹岸-28377?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">緹岸</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"山景\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:山景;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/山景-23904?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">山景</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"屯門\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:屯門;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/屯門-27309?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">屯門</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"大圍\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:大圍;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/大圍-27321?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">大圍</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">延伸閱讀:</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">* <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"新聞連結\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:新聞連結;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/news/%E8%9F%B2%E8%8D%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%8E%8B-%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%8D%E8%B1%AA%E5%AE%85%E6%B7%AA%E9%8A%80%E4%B8%BB%E7%9B%A4-%E7%91%9E%E5%B3%B0%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92%E4%B8%80%E7%B1%83%E5%AD%90%E7%89%A9%E6%A5%AD%E9%96%8B%E5%83%B93-255%E8%90%AC-78662?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78662\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">新聞連結</a>。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">* <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"28Hse App\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:28Hse App;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/appdownload?utm_source=yahoo&amp;